===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*lendʰ- (loin)}}
The {{glossary|noun}} is borrowed from {{bor|en|LL.|lumbāgō|t=backache of the lumbar region}}, from {{m+|LL.|lumbus|t=lumbar}}, {{der|en|la|lumbus|t=loin}}<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=111056|date=1903|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref> (ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*lendʰ-|t=loins}}) + {{m|la|-āgō|pos={{glossary|suffix}} forming nouns describing objects, animals, and plants}}.

The {{glossary|verb}} is derived from the noun.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=v|id=111057|date=1903}}</ref>

